return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T18:00:29+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T18:00:29+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Ka iibi martigelinta Zinn Digital® mareegtaada WordPress — martigelinta WordPress, WooCommerce, wakaaladda, dib-u-iibiyaha, daruurta iyo VPS. Ka raadi oo ka bixi magacyada domain-ka koontadaada dib-u-iibiyaha, si toos ah macaamiishaada ugu saxiix qaybta martigelintooda, oo si toos ah u diyaari martigelinta marka la bixiyo lacagta dalabka WooCommerce.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Madasha martigelintu waxay ku jawaabtay xaaladda %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Raadi magacaaga domain-ka','Search'=>'Raadi','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Wax kordhin ah looma hubin magacaas.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Raadinta domain-ka lama heli karo goobtan wakhtigan xaadirka ah.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Ma aannu gaari karin diiwaanka domain-ka hadda. Fadlan isku day mar kale cabbaar ka dib.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.'=>'Furaha API wuu maqan yahay ama hadda ma shaqeynayo. Ka hubi qeybta Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Furaha API ma wato ogolaanshaha sites.view, kaas oo baadhitaanka domain-ku u baahan yahay. Ku dar furaha ku jira qaybtaada iibiyaha (reseller panel), ama halkan ka tirtir furaha si aad ugu noqoto baadhitaanka guud.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Kaliya maamulayaasha ayaa arki kara tan:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Ma aanan hubin karin tan — mar kale isku day','Already registered'=>'Horey u diiwaangashan','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Waa la heli karaa — na weydii qiimaha','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Waa la heli karaa — %1$s %2$s sanadka koowaad','Register it'=>'Diiwaangeli','Manage my hosting'=>'Maamul martigelintayda','Please sign in first.'=>'Fadlan marka hore gal.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Koontani weli kuma xirna adeeg martigelin.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Madasha martigelintu ma aysan soo celin xiriiriye lagu galo.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Qalabka Dib-u-iibiyaha','Account'=>'Koontada','Features'=>'Astaamaha','Styling'=>'Habeynta muuqaalka','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakiilada AI (MCP)','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'U oggolow wakiillada AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Dami: aaladaha hoose iyo waddooyinkooda REST gabi ahaanba ma diiwaangashana.','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Koontadaada iibiyaha Zinn Digital®','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Ka samee furaha API-ga dib-u-iibiyaha dashboard-kaaga Zinn® ee hoos taga Developer → API keys, ka dibna halkan ku dheji.','Reseller API key'=>'Furaha API ee dib-u-iibiyaha','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'Waxaa lagu hayaa goobtan oo keliya, weligoodna laguma daro dhoofinta ama warbixinta baaritaanka cilladaha.','Plan to provision'=>'Qorshaha la diyaarinayo','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Koodhka qorshaha la siiyo macaamiisha cusub. Banaan kaga tag si laguugu weydiiyo mar kasta.','API address'=>'Cinwaanka API','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Faraha ka qaad tan ilaa ay taageerada Zinn® ku weydiisato inaad beddesho mooyee.','Control-panel address'=>'Cinwaanka guddiga maamulka','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'Halka xiriirinta "Martigelintayda" ay u dirto macaamiishaada.','Domain search'=>'Raadinta domain-ka','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'Bixi koodka gaaban ee [zinn_domain_search]','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Geli koodka gaaban bog kasta si aad u oggolaato booqdayaasha inay hubiyaan domain-ka oo ay adiga xagaaga kaga iibsadaan.','Panel link'=>'Xiriirka guddiga','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Macaamiisha soo galay u muuji xiriirinta "Martigelintayda"','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'Bixinta WooCommerce','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'Si toos ah u bixi martigelinta marka dalabka WooCommerce uu dhammaado','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Waxay kaliya dhaqangashaa dalabyada ay ku jiraan badeecad aad ku xirtay qorshaha Zinn®.','Domain search appearance'=>'Muuqaalka raadinta bogga','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Widget-kan wuxuu ka dhex muuqanayaa mawduucaaga gaarka ah. Dooro hab hore loo diyaariyay, ama deji midabadaada gaarka ah — si kasta oo ay tahay, waxba laguma daro bogaggaaga oo booqdahu u arki karo inay annaga naga yimaadeen.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'Fasalka kasta oo widget-ku adeegsado waxay ku qoran tahay readme-ga plugin-ka, si horumariyuhu u beddeli karo wax kasta oo goobta hore loo sii diyaariyey aysan dabooleyn.','Follow my theme'=>'Raac mawduucayga','Soft'=>'Jilicsan','High contrast'=>'Kala duwanaansho sare','Compact'=>'Isku kooban','Buy-link colour'=>'Midabka xiriirinta iibsiga','“Available” colour'=>'Midabka "La heli karo"','“Could not check” colour'=>'Midabka "Lama hubin karo"','Error colour'=>'Midabka khaladka','Corner rounding'=>'Geesaska wareegsan','Space inside each row'=>'Masaafada ku dhex jirta saf kasta','Text size'=>'Cabirka qoraalka','Domain-name weight'=>'Miisaanka magaca domain-ka','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Weli ma jiro furaha API-ga dib-u-iibiyaha.','Domain search already works without one, at the public prices. The panel link and WooCommerce provisioning need a key: create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys.'=>'Raadinta goobta internetka (domain) mar horeba waxay ku shaqaysaa la\'aanteed, qiimayaasha guud. Xiriirinta guddiga iyo bixinta WooCommerce waxay u baahan yihiin furre: mid kaga sameyso dashboard-kaaga Zinn® hoostiisa Developer → API keys.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Fur dashboard-kayga Zinn®','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'Fure ayaa la dejiyay, laakiin waxba lama shidin.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Midna saddexda astaamood lama hawlgelin, markaa furiintan waxba kama qabanayso bartaada. Daar waxaad u baahan tahay qaybta Astaamaha hoosteeda.','Open Features'=>'Fur Astaamaha','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'Diyaar — %d muuqaal baa la shiday.' . "\0" . 'Diyaar — %d astaamood ayaa la shiday.','Selling from'=>'Ka iibinta','Settings'=>'Habsocodka','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Weli ma jiro furaha API, markaa waxba kuma xirna.','Not connected: %s'=>'Kuma xirna: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'Waa lagu xiray. Barnaamijkaaga dib-u-iibiyaha waa %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Ma jiro fure Zinn® API ah oo la habeeyay, marka waxba lama diyaarin.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Dalabkan kuma jirin magac domain, markaa ma jirin wax la diyaariyo.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Madal-martigelintu ma aysan soo celin degel.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® waxaa loo diyaariyay %1$s (adeegga %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Madal-martigelintu ma soo celin koonto macmiil.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® LAMA diyaarin: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Khadka alaabta Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Khadka badeecada Zinn® ee la bixinayo marka badeecadan la iibsado. Bannaan ka tag si aad u isticmaasho qiimaha caadiga ah ee habaynta fur-xiraha.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Martigelinta Zinn®','Service id'=>'Aqoonsiga adeegga','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Waxba looma diyaarin dalabkan.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Waa la keydiyay. Qor qiimo cusub si aad ugu beddesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Kala sifee liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Kala soco liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Waxba lama mid aha shaandhadaas.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar guud','Overview'=>'Guudmar','Copied'=>'Waa la koobiyey','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Xirmo kasta oo Zinn® ah oo ku yaal boggan, iyo haddii uu shaqeynayo.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Xiriir looma baahna furahan.','Open settings'=>'Fur habaynta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Uma lihid ogolaansho inaad bedesho goobahan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha habaynta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Keydi isbeddellada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofi habaynta','Reset to defaults'=>'Dib u deji qiimaha asalka ah','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay dib u celinaysaa dhammaan habaynta plugin-kan midkiisa caadiga ah. Ma doonaysaa inaad sii wadato?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Baaritaanka taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo geli faylka habaynta','Import'=>'Soo dhoofso','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyay waligood kuma jiraan furaha sirta ah, calaamadaha ama furayaasha API — waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad markale geliso goobta cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Habsocodyada waa la kaydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Dhammaan habaynta plugin-kan waxay ku noqdeen koodii caadiga ahaa.','Done.'=>'Waa dhammaatay.','That action is not available.'=>'Falkaas lama heli karo.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faylkaas lama akhrin karin. Dooro faylka habaynta ee laga soo dhoofiyay furin Zinn® ah.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi aad buu u weyn yahay inuu noqdo dhoofinta habaynta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi ma aha dhoofinta habaynta Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faylkaas waxaa laga soo dhoofiyay furin kale (%s), markaa halkan oo la soo geliyo waxay kaydinaysaa habayn aysan furintani fahmin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d habayn ayaa la soo dejiyay. Furaha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan dhoofinta, markaa dib u geli kuwaas.' . "\0" . '%d habayn ayaa la soo dejiyay. Erayada sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan dhoofinta, markaa dib u geli kuwaas.','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Connecting…'=>'Waa la xiriirinayaa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin wax baa u baahan fiiro gaar ah','Not connected'=>'Kuma xirna','Running on your own account'=>'Ku shaqeynaya koontadaada gaarka ah','We could not check this'=>'Waan hubin weynay tan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Furintaan ma aysan sheegin sababta. Dir warbixinta ogaanshaha cilladaha waxaana aan eegi doonnaa.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xiriirka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Markii ugu dambeysay ee la hubiyay waxay ahayd %s ka hor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'U dir tan taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Tani waa sida saxda ah waxa la diri doono — wax kale ma jiraan, waxna ma qarsoona. Furahaaga sirta ah, calaamadaha iyo furayaasha API kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta ogaanshaha cilladda ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ku koobi kiliboodhka','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'U dir warbixintan taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu furaynaa tigidh taageero waxaanan kaga jawaabaynaa iimayl. Haddii aad doorbidid inaadan dirin, kor ka koobiyeey oo adigu tigidh ku dheji.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Kama aan gaari karin Zinn Digital® server-kan (%s). Nuqul ka qaad warbixinta sare oo taa beddelkeeda fur tikidh — wax khalad ah oo ku jira habayntaada ma jiraan.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxayna kaga soo jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada — tixraac %s — waxayna kaga jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad muddo gaaban gudaheed ku dirtay warbixinno dhowr ah. Sug dhowr daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day — kuwii hore way soo gaareen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma aqbali karin warbixinta hadda — taasi waa xaggeenna, ma aha xaggaaga. Isku day mar dhow mar kale, ama ku koobi warbixinta kore tikidh.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Nuqul ka samee xagga sare oo fur tigidh, adoo xusaya lambarkaas.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaal iyo adeegyo','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri buug-tilmaameedka isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari kani','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta xogta maalinlaha ah, wareejin bilaash ah iyo qaybta xakamaynta oo loo dhisay dadka maamula wax ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi boggag dhisan, magacyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyeyaasha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo haynayo ilaa ay labada dhinacba ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaalayso dad shaqo ahaan u qabta arrintan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa xorta ah ee caalamiga ah: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka yimid qorayaal, naqshadeeyayaal, sameeyayaal softiweer iyo khubaro SEO, ama daabac mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab ku soo gudbiyaan.','Style preset'=>'Hab-dhismeedka hore loo diyaariyay','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Barta bilowga. Wax kasta oo ka hooseeya ayaa beddelaya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabbadayda iyo cabbirradayda gaarka ah','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Tan dami oo u daa, habka hore loo habeeyayna waxaa loo isticmaali doonaa sida uu yahay.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Eeg qoraalada warbixinta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta Zinn® ma soo saarin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani gaari karo goobta Zinn®, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® (%s). Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo kaddib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay waxay ku guuldarraysatay hubinta sugnaanshaheeda lamana rakibin.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Falka lama dhamaystiri karin. Fadlan mar kale isku day, haddii ay weli shaqayn weydana, la xiriir maamulaha goobta.','Connect an AI app'=>'Ku xidh barnaamijka AI','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Codsigan isku-xirka wuu dhacay. Ku noqo abka oo mar kale billow isku-xirka.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s waxa uu codsanayaa in uu ku isticmaalo %2$s goobtan sidii %3$s. Waxa kaliya ee uu samayn karaa waa waxa akoonkaaga WordPress loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo, waxaanad ka jari kartaa wakhti kasta goobaha wakiilada AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s waxa uu iska aqoonsaday %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ayaa si toos ah isu diiwaangeliyay. Kaliya sii wad haddii aad tan ka bilowday %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Koontadaadu ma isticmaali karto aaladahan boggan. Weydii maamulaha.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Markaad jawaabto ka dib waxaad dib ugu noqon doontaa %s.','Allow %s'=>'Oggolow %s','Do not allow'=>'Ha oggolaan','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Qiime loo baahnaa ayaa maqan ama qaab khaldan ku jira. Hubi nidaamka gelinta (input schema) ee awoodda.','The site refused the request.'=>'Boggu wuxuu diiday codsigii.','Unknown tool.'=>'Qalab aan la garanayn.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'U oggolow kaaliyeyaasha AI sida Claude, Cursor ama VS Code inay boggan kaaga shaqeeyaan iyagoo adeegsanaya MCP (Model Context Protocol). Waxay ku soo galaan isticmaale WordPress ahaan (Claude iyo ChatGPT adoo halkan ku ansixinaya, kuwa kalena sirta arjiga) waxayna samayn karaan oo keliya waxa isticmaalahaas loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakiilada AI waxay u baahan yihiin WordPress 6.9 ama ka dambeeya. Cusboonaysii WordPress si aad u isticmaasho.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirka (barta dhammaadka ee MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude iyo ChatGPT: taa beddelkeeda gal','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ku dar ciwaanka xiriirinta sidii xiriiriye gaar ah oo ku jira Claude, ama sidii app ku jira qaabka horumariyaha ChatGPT. Waxay furaan boggan si aad u ansixiso; ma jirto furaha sirta ah oo la koobiyeeyo.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Barnaamijyada AI ee ku xiran koontadaada:','Disconnect'=>'Ka jar','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'App-yada kale ee AI: furaha sirta ah ee abka','Create an application password for your user'=>'U samee furaha sirta ah ee abka isticmaalahaaga','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ku dar tan habaynta MCP ee barnaamijkaaga AI, adigoo isticmaalaya magacaaga isticmaale iyo eraygaas sirta ah:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: geli isla gelitaanka hoosta "servers" ee .vscode/mcp.json, hana gelin hoosta "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Aaladaha wakiilka AI uu halkan ku isticmaali karo (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha: Wakiilada AI iyo MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dukumentiyada horumariyaha: awoodaha, REST iyo MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'Ka maamul macamiishaada martigelinta, qorshayaashooda iyo boggagooda Zinn Digital® boggan.','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'Macaamiishaada, qorshayaashooda iyo boggagooda, adoo adeegsanaya koontadaada dib-u-iibiyaha Zinn Digital®.','Read your reseller account'=>'Akhri koontadaada dib-u-iibiyaha','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'Waxay ku soo celisaa akoonkaaga dib-u-iibiyaha hal akhrin: calaamadda, qorshayaasha, tirada macaamiisha iyo adeegyada, iyo waxa la habeeyay.','List your clients'=>'Qor macaamiishaada','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'Wuxuu taxaa xisaabaadka macmiilkaaga, hal bog mar keliya (cursor, limit).','Create a client'=>'Abuur macmiil','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'Waxay akoonkaaga hoos ka abuuraysaa akoon macmiil (name; default_currency, koodh ka kooban saddex xaraf). Geli qorshe ka hor barta ay ku leeyihiin ee ugu horreysa.','Read a client\'s plan'=>'Akhri qorshaha macmiilka','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'Waxay soo celisaa qorshaha macmiilku ku jiro iyo inta ay kugu kacayso (client_id).','Put a client on a plan'=>'Macaamiil u qoondee qorshe','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'Macaamiil ku dara mid ka mid ah qorshayaashaada (client_id, plan_code; interval: month ama year). Tan samee ka hor barta ay ku leeyihiin ee ugu horreysa.','List the plans you can sell'=>'Liis garee qorshayaasha aad iibin karto','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'Wuxuu taxaa qorshayaasha martigelinta iyo qiimahooda (product_line iyo currency ayaa soo koobaya).','List your clients\' sites'=>'Liis garee boggaga macaamiishaada','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa wax walba oo aad u diyaarisay macaamiishaada (client_id iyo status ayaa xadida), hal bog markiiba.','Create a site for a client'=>'Macaamiil u samee degel','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'Waxay u abuurtaa degel la martigeliyay mid ka mid ah macaamiishaada (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). Waxaa lagugu soo dalacayaa koontadaada iyadoo la raacayo qorshaha macmiilka, sida dukaankaaga oo kale.','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'Jooji bogga macmiilka','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'Waxay gelinaysaa bogga macmiilka hakad lacag-bixin la\'aan awgeed (site_id; reason: qoraalkaaga gaarka ah, waligeed lama tuso macmiilka). Boggu wuxuu joojinayaa shaqada ilaa laga qaado hakinta.','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'Ka qaad joojinta goobta macmiilka','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'Waxay meesha ka saaraysaa xayiraadda lacag-bixin la\'aanta, si goobtu mar kale u shaqeyso (site_id).','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Akhriso habaynta Reseller Toolkit-ka','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa habaynta furinkan (cinwaanka API-ga, qorshaha ay isticmaalaan dalabyada cusub, astaamaha shaqaynaya). Furaha API-ga waligii lama soo celiyo, kaliya haddii mid la keydiyay iyo haddii kale.','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Beddel habaynta Reseller Toolkit','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa habaynta aad dirtay (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) waxayna haysaa inta kale. Furaha API-ga iyo ciwaanka waxa laga beddelay shaashadda oo keliya.','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'Marka hore ku dar furahaaga API ee dib-u-iibiyaha Zinn Digital® shaashadda Reseller Toolkit.']];